<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en-GB"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Improve disconnected workflows, business systems, automation, ERP, integrations, data and decision visibility with a problem-led approach."><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"><link rel="canonical" href="https://novadot.co.uk/services/software-ai-business-systems/"><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/brand/novadot-mark.png"><meta name="theme-color" content="#fcfbf8"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:title" content="Software, AI &amp; Business Systems | NovaDot"><meta property="og:description" content="Improve disconnected workflows, business systems, automation, ERP, integrations, data and decision visibility with a problem-led approach."><meta property="og:url" content="https://novadot.co.uk/services/software-ai-business-systems/"><meta property="og:image" content="https://novadot.co.uk/brand/novadot-share-preview.png"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="NovaDot — Independent systems architecture, custom software, and managed cloud operations"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:title" content="Software, AI &amp; Business Systems | NovaDot"><meta name="twitter:description" content="Improve disconnected workflows, business systems, automation, ERP, integrations, data and decision visibility with a problem-led approach."><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://novadot.co.uk/brand/novadot-share-preview.png"><title>Software, AI &amp; Business Systems | NovaDot</title><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"NovaDot","legalName":"NOVADOT LTD","url":"https://novadot.co.uk","logo":"https://novadot.co.uk/brand/novadot-full-logo-hires.png","description":"NovaDot helps UK organisations plan, build, improve and support software, systems and digital services.","email":"hello@novadot.co.uk","telephone":"+44 (0)116 436 1235","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"First Floor, 18B Tithe Street","addressLocality":"Leicester","addressRegion":"Leicestershire","postalCode":"LE5 4BN","addressCountry":"GB"}}</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/ArcGraphic.DOqw_ipj.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/software-ai-business-systems.DC9VjVKG.css"><script defer src="https://scanner.novadot.co.uk/novadot-analytics.v1.072ff0e7fc53.js" integrity="sha384-5sIvO4uGVSOkyWi+5uhod+c65rFwppXlcnGxsJSiig2jKQ2Vvn8YtmfbDYCnz1CG" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" data-site="nd_ne8NN6cbqgvgMTNvcC_zIfoY47NW8pSs" data-routes="%2F,%2Fabout,%2Fcontact"></script>
</head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a><header class="site-header" data-site-header><div class="site-header__inner shell"><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home"><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot"></a><nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/services/" data-section-current="true">Services</a><a href="/events/">Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/">How We Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a></nav><a class="button button--primary header-cta" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a><button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation menu" aria-controls="mobile-navigation" aria-expanded="false" data-menu-toggle><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div></header><nav id="mobile-navigation" class="mobile-nav" aria-label="Mobile navigation" hidden data-mobile-nav><div class="shell mobile-nav__inner"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/services/" data-section-current="true">Services</a><div class="mobile-nav__services" role="group" aria-label="Service areas"><a href="/services/software-ai-business-systems/" aria-current="page">Software, AI &amp; Business Systems</a><a href="/services/web-mobile-digital-growth/">Web, Mobile &amp; Digital Growth</a><a href="/services/cloud-security-it-operations/">Cloud, Security &amp; IT Operations</a></div><a href="/events/">Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/">How We Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div></nav><script type="module">var e=document.querySelector(`[data-menu-toggle]`),t=document.querySelector(`[data-mobile-nav]`);if(e instanceof HTMLButtonElement&&t instanceof HTMLElement){let n=[document.querySelector(`.skip-link`),document.querySelector(`main`),document.querySelector(`footer`)].filter(e=>e instanceof HTMLElement),r=e=>{n.forEach(t=>{t.inert=e})},i=(n=!1)=>{let i=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,`false`),e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,`Open navigation menu`),t.hidden=!0,document.body.classList.remove(`menu-open`),r(!1),n&&i&&e.focus()};e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>{let n=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)!==`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,String(n)),e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,n?`Close navigation menu`:`Open navigation menu`),t.hidden=!n,document.body.classList.toggle(`menu-open`,n),r(n)}),t.querySelectorAll(`a`).forEach(e=>e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>i())),document.addEventListener(`keydown`,n=>{if(n.key===`Escape`&&i(!0),n.key===`Tab`&&e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`){let r=[e,...t.querySelectorAll(`a`)],i=r[0],a=r.at(-1);n.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===i?(n.preventDefault(),a?.focus()):!n.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===a&&(n.preventDefault(),i.focus())}}),window.matchMedia(`(min-width: 960px)`).addEventListener(`change`,e=>{e.matches&&i()})}</script><main id="main-content"><section class="page-hero"><div class="shell page-hero__grid"><div class="page-hero__copy"><p class="eyebrow">Software, AI &amp; Business Systems</p><h1>Connect the systems, data and work your team depends on.</h1><p class="page-hero__lead">When information is re-entered, systems disagree or a key workflow relies on manual hand-offs, we help define the problem and compare repair, configuration, integration, automation and selective build options.</p><a class="button button--primary page-hero__action" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div><div class="page-hero__graphic"><svg class="arc-graphic arc-graphic--compact" viewBox="0 0 620 620" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"><path d="M598 76C400 76 238 184 238 316s162 228 360 228" opacity=".16"></path><path d="M598 116C426 116 286 205 286 316s140 188 312 188" opacity=".24"></path><path d="M598 158C454 158 337 228 337 316s117 146 261 146" opacity=".38"></path><path d="M598 201C485 201 392 252 392 316s93 103 206 103" opacity=".62"></path><path d="M598 245C516 245 448 277 448 316s68 60 150 60"></path><path d="M83 316H448" opacity=".5"></path></g><circle cx="448" cy="316" r="7" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg></div></div></section><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="systems-triggers-title" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><div class="shell content-grid" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><p class="content-grid__aside" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Common problems</p><div class="prose" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><h2 id="systems-triggers-title" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>When to ask for help</h2><ul class="trigger-list" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Teams copy information between email, spreadsheets and business systems.</li><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Order, stock, fulfilment, finance or customer records do not stay aligned.</li><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Reports arrive too late or require repeated reconciliation.</li><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>An ERP or CRM change is planned, but scope and migration risk are unclear.</li><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Repetitive information work may suit bounded automation or AI.</li><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>An existing platform works partly, but a defined integration gap remains.</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="content-section content-section--porcelain" aria-labelledby="systems-decision-title" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><div class="shell content-grid" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><p class="content-grid__aside" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Decision</p><div class="prose" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><h2 id="systems-decision-title" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Configure, connect, build—or leave the system alone?</h2><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>We compare the cost and risk of the current process with lower-risk changes, supported products, existing capability and a bounded technical gap. A custom build is recommended only when a material need remains.</p></div></div></section><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="systems-architecture-title" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><div class="shell" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><div class="section-heading-grid" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><div data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><p class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Architectural clarity</p><h2 id="systems-architecture-title" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>From disconnected silos to an accountable core.</h2></div><div class="section-heading__aside" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Compare how data moves through isolated spreadsheets and email hand-offs versus a joined-up operational platform.</p></div></div><div class="arch-comparison" data-arch-root data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><div class="arch-toggle-bar" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><div class="arch-toggle-info" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><span class="arch-toggle-label" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>System view:</span><p class="arch-disclaimer" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Illustrative workflow — features and results depend on the agreed system.</p></div><div class="arch-toggle-group" role="group" aria-label="Toggle system architecture state" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><button type="button" class="arch-toggle-btn active" data-state="before" aria-pressed="true" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><span class="indicator-dot indicator-dot--problem" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl></span>Before: Disconnected &amp; Manual</button><button type="button" class="arch-toggle-btn" data-state="after" aria-pressed="false" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><span class="indicator-dot indicator-dot--solution" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl></span>After: Connected &amp; Accountable</button></div></div><!-- BEFORE VIEW --><div class="arch-diagram arch-diagram--before" data-view="before" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><div class="arch-node arch-node--source" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><span class="arch-node__badge" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Silo 1</span><strong data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Orders &amp; Enquiries</strong><p data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Manual spreadsheets &amp; email inboxes</p></div><div class="arch-connection arch-connection--broken" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><span class="arch-arrow" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>⇢</span><span class="arch-connection__note" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Repeated entry</span></div><div class="arch-node arch-node--source" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><span class="arch-node__badge" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Silo 2</span><strong data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Inventory &amp; Operations</strong><p data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Standalone spreadsheets or older database</p></div><div class="arch-connection arch-connection--broken" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><span class="arch-arrow" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>⇢</span><span class="arch-connection__note" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Delayed hand-off</span></div><div class="arch-node arch-node--source" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><span class="arch-node__badge" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Silo 3</span><strong data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Finance &amp; Accounts</strong><p data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Separate accounting tool with manual reconciliation</p></div><div class="arch-status-box arch-status-box--problem" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><strong data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Operational friction:</strong><span data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Repeated data entry, delayed reporting and difficulty tracking work across teams</span></div></div><!-- AFTER VIEW --><div class="arch-diagram arch-diagram--after" data-view="after" hidden data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><div class="arch-grid-hub" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><div class="arch-node arch-node--hub" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><span class="arch-node__badge arch-node__badge--mint" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Core System</span><strong data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Connected System (e.g. Odoo)</strong><p data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Single source of operational information</p></div><div class="arch-spokes" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><div class="arch-spoke" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><span class="arch-spoke__arrow" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>↔</span><div data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><strong data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Sales &amp; Customer Orders</strong><p data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Direct entry or automated website integration</p></div></div><div class="arch-spoke" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><span class="arch-spoke__arrow" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>↔</span><div data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><strong data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Inventory &amp; Stock</strong><p data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Clear stock visibility across sales and purchasing</p></div></div><div class="arch-spoke" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><span class="arch-spoke__arrow" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>↔</span><div data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><strong data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Finance &amp; Reconciliation</strong><p data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Bank integrations and reporting, where supported and included in scope</p></div></div></div></div><div class="arch-status-box arch-status-box--solution" data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl><strong data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Operational outcome:</strong><span data-astro-cid-hfkbncyl>Connected records, clearer reporting and agreed responsibilities across departments</span></div></div></div><script type="module">document.querySelectorAll(`[data-arch-root]`).forEach(e=>{let t=e.querySelectorAll(`[data-state]`),n=e.querySelector(`[data-view="before"]`),r=e.querySelector(`[data-view="after"]`);t.forEach(e=>{e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>{let i=e.getAttribute(`data-state`);t.forEach(t=>{let n=t===e;t.classList.toggle(`active`,n),t.setAttribute(`aria-pressed`,n?`true`:`false`)}),i===`before`?(n&&(n.hidden=!1),r&&(r.hidden=!0)):(n&&(n.hidden=!0),r&&(r.hidden=!1))})})});</script></div></section><section class="content-section content-section--porcelain" aria-labelledby="odoo-capabilities-title" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><div class="shell content-grid" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><p class="content-grid__aside" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>ERP &amp; Odoo scope</p><div class="prose" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><h2 id="odoo-capabilities-title" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Odoo implementation and business systems experience</h2><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Rather than building complex accounting, stock or CRM engines from scratch, NovaDot brings practical experience implementing, configuring, and supporting <strong data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Odoo ERP</strong> alongside tailored software where custom capability is strictly justified.</p><div class="odoo-scope-grid" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><div class="odoo-scope-card" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><h3 data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Configuration &amp; Setup</h3><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Tailoring standard Odoo modules (Sales, Invoicing, Inventory, CRM, Accounting) to your operational workflow.</p></div><div class="odoo-scope-card" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><h3 data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Bespoke Customisation</h3><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Developing dedicated Python modules and custom views when standard features do not fit your required process.</p></div><div class="odoo-scope-card" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><h3 data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Data Migration</h3><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Structured legacy data cleansing, reconciliation, and verified migration from older ERPs, databases, or spreadsheets.</p></div><div class="odoo-scope-card" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><h3 data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>API &amp; System Integration</h3><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Connecting Odoo with websites, portals, payment services and supported banking integrations.</p></div><div class="odoo-scope-card" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><h3 data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>AI &amp; Workflow Automation</h3><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Start with one repeatable task, suitable data and a way to check outputs. We explore scoped pilots with clear approval checks.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="ai-demo-title" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><div class="shell content-grid" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><p class="content-grid__aside" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>AI in practice</p><div class="prose" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><h2 id="ai-demo-title" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>From invoice documents to a reviewable summary</h2><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>This example uses three fictional invoice and receipt text files to prepare a summary of supplier, document number, date, net amount, tax amount, total and payment status. One document does not show its tax amount, so that field is marked for human review. The demonstration fills a sample bookkeeping form; it does not post to a live accounting system.</p><div class="demo-flow-grid" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><div class="demo-step" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><span class="demo-step-num" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Step 1</span><h3 data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Input Text Records</h3><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Three fictional plain-text records: <code data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>invoice-1007.txt</code>, <code data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>invoice-missing-tax.txt</code>, and <code data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>receipt-phone-repair.txt</code>.</p></div><div class="demo-step" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><span class="demo-step-num" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Step 2</span><h3 data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Extracted Summary</h3><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Automated parsing extracts vendor name, document ID, date, net subtotal, tax amount, total, and payment status.</p></div><div class="demo-step demo-step--alert" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><span class="demo-step-num" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Step 3</span><h3 data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Exception Flagged</h3><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>The cleaning invoice does not show a tax amount. The pipeline marks that field as <em data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>needs review</em> instead of guessing.</p></div><div class="demo-step" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><span class="demo-step-num" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Step 4</span><h3 data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Human Verification</h3><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>A designated reviewer checks the missing tax field, confirms correct VAT treatment, and approves draft entry into a demo form.</p></div></div><!-- Sample CSV Output Preview --><div class="demo-table-wrapper" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><table class="demo-table" aria-label="Sample demonstration summary table" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><thead data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><tr data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><th scope="col" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Source file</th><th scope="col" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Vendor / Supplier</th><th scope="col" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Doc #</th><th scope="col" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Date</th><th scope="col" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Net (£)</th><th scope="col" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Tax (£)</th><th scope="col" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Total (£)</th><th scope="col" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Payment status</th></tr></thead><tbody data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><tr data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><code data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>invoice-1007.txt</code></td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>NOVA SAMPLE SUPPLIES LTD</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>INV-1007</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>2026-06-05</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>95.50</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>19.10</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>114.60</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><span class="status-tag status-tag--unpaid" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>unpaid</span></td></tr><tr class="demo-row--exception" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><code data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>invoice-missing-tax.txt</code></td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Bright Office Cleaning</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>BO-7781</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>2026-06-08</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>178.00</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><span class="flag-badge" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>needs review</span></td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>178.00</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><span class="status-tag status-tag--paid" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>paid</span></td></tr><tr data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><code data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>receipt-phone-repair.txt</code></td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Mobile Fix Sample Shop</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>R-44291</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>2026-06-07</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>28.00</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>5.60</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>33.60</td><td data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><span class="status-tag status-tag--paid" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>paid</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="demo-note" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Demonstration run summary: fills a sample browser-based bookkeeping test form; does not post to a live accounting system.</p><div class="demo-actions" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><a class="button button--secondary" href="/contact/?topic=ai-automation" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Discuss a workflow like this</a></div></div></div></section><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="example-deliverable-title" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><div class="shell content-grid" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><p class="content-grid__aside" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Sample deliverable</p><div class="prose" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><h2 id="example-deliverable-title" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>What you receive: workflow and data integration specification</h2><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Before any configuration or software build begins, we produce a clear, reviewable specification so all parties agree on the data model, system boundaries, and hand-offs.</p><div class="deliverable-card" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><div class="deliverable-block" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><span class="deliverable-label" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Starting problem</span><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Order and customer data is re-entered manually from web orders into spreadsheets and accounting, causing fulfillment delays and reconciliation gaps.</p></div><div class="deliverable-block" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><span class="deliverable-label" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Example outputs included in the pack</span><ul class="deliverable-list" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><strong data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>System boundary map:</strong> Diagram showing the authoritative source for customer, stock, and financial records.</li><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><strong data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Field-level mapping sheet:</strong> Explicit translation table (e.g., checkout line items mapped to ERP chart of accounts and tax codes).</li><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><strong data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Validation &amp; exception rules:</strong> Documented handling for missing tax IDs, duplicate order numbers, and currency conversion.</li><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><strong data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Acceptance test checklist:</strong> Step-by-step verification scenarios with test data for client sign-off.</li></ul></div><div class="deliverable-block" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><span class="deliverable-label" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>What the client supplies</span><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Sample anonymised export records, current workflow descriptions, and availability of team members who process daily orders.</p></div><div class="deliverable-block deliverable-block--boundary" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><span class="deliverable-label" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>What needs separate agreement</span><p data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Live bi-directional multi-system synchronization, legacy data cleansing, custom third-party ERP module development, or out-of-hours deployment support.</p></div><div class="deliverable-actions" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><a class="button button--secondary" href="/contact/?topic=systems-specification" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Discuss your integration specification</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="content-section" aria-label="Good fit and project alignment" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><div class="shell fit-grid" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><article class="fit-panel" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><p class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Good fit</p><h2 data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Good fit</h2><ul data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>one material workflow and accountable owner;</li><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>safe access to representative, redacted evidence;</li><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>a defined consequence and decision window; and</li><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>willingness to compare products, partners and smaller changes.</li></ul></article><article class="fit-panel fit-panel--muted" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><p class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Project alignment</p><h2 data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>Before we quote</h2><ul data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>We agree whether an initial assessment is needed, what it includes, and any fee.</li><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>We agree what delivery milestones and ongoing support we can commit to.</li><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>We ensure the project has a clear scope and a named person to approve decisions.</li><li data-astro-cid-wc6cm3ex>We compare the options honestly before recommending any custom build.</li></ul></article></div></section><section class="closing-cta"><svg class="arc-graphic arc-graphic--compact closing-cta__arc" viewBox="0 0 620 620" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"><path d="M598 76C400 76 238 184 238 316s162 228 360 228" opacity=".16"></path><path d="M598 116C426 116 286 205 286 316s140 188 312 188" opacity=".24"></path><path d="M598 158C454 158 337 228 337 316s117 146 261 146" opacity=".38"></path><path d="M598 201C485 201 392 252 392 316s93 103 206 103" opacity=".62"></path><path d="M598 245C516 245 448 277 448 316s68 60 150 60"></path><path d="M83 316H448" opacity=".5"></path></g><circle cx="448" cy="316" r="7" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg><div class="shell closing-cta__inner"><h2>Show us where the hand-off breaks.</h2><p>Describe the workflow, systems involved and the consequence of the current gap.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="shell footer-grid" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="footer-brand" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if></a><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>NovaDot helps UK organisations plan, build, improve and support software, systems and digital services.</p></div><div class="footer-links" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Work</h2><a href="/services/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Services</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Company</h2><a href="/events/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>How We Work</a><a href="/about/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>About</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</h2><a href="/contact/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Legal</h2><a href="/privacy-policy/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Terms</a></div></div></div><div class="shell footer-legal" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>© 2026 NOVADOT LTD. Registered in England and Wales. Company number 07691369.</p></div></footer></body></html>